<title>UK: Dalgety finance director to retire.</title>
<headline>Dalgety finance director to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pet food and agribusiness group Dalgety Plc said finance director John Martyn would retire from the board in March 1997.</p>
<p>Martyn, who became finance director in 1987, plans to spend more time on his non-executive interests and the voluntary sector.</p>
<p>The group has started looking for a successor and expects to make an announcement early next year. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
